Source: sg-shell
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Stained Glass OS <dev@stained-glass.example>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), gcc-mingw-w64-x86-64, gcc-mingw-w64-i686
Standards-Version: 4.7.0
Homepage: https://github.com/Stained-Glass-OS/sg-shell
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: sg-shell
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, wine-sg | wine
Description: Stained Glass OS shell panels (Windows 10 Start menu)
 Windows 10-style panels for the surfaces Wine's explorer does not provide --
 currently sg-start, the Start menu. The taskbar's appearance is handled in
 wine-sg, not here. Panels install as PE programs under
 /usr/libexec/stained-glass/shell.
